{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Path to Ascension: a vanilla realm offers the vanilla tutorial variants and hides the Wrath ones",
  "contract": "PathToAscension.Expansion defaults to 0 (Vanilla). The client shows a Tutorial.dbc row whose expansion (field 33) is 3 or equals the expansion it derives from MaxPlayerLevel; the test config's MaxPlayerLevel 80 makes that Wrath (2). At login the server therefore patches (SMSG_TUTORIAL_PATCH 0x6A5) the vanilla rows PvP Power 9 and Normal: Molten Core 122 to expansion 3, and the Wrath rows PvP Power 259 and Heroic Dungeons 261 to expansion 0 so the client hides them. Normal: Naxxramas 127 is not made visible because Naxxramas is still a level 80 Wrath raid here, and the Burning Crusade row Normal: Karazhan 149 already stays hidden. 270 equipped PvP Power (eight soulbound level 60 PvP pieces) verifies tutorials 9 and 259, which share quest 580140. A claim of 259 is refused as unavailable and records nothing; a claim of 9 is answered CLAIM_TUTORIAL_OK and recorded.",
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "pvper",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 60
    }
  ],
  "location": {
    "map": 0,
    "x": -8833.38,
    "y": 628.628,
    "z": 94.0066,
    "o": 1.06535
  },
  "steps": [
